226			A_a^u \ot I \simeq_\eps I \ot B^{\ell}_{[f(u)=a]},
227			\qquad
228			A_a^u \ot I \simeq_\delta I \ot A_a^u,
229			\qquad
230			A_a^u \ot I \simeq_\gamma I \ot L^{\ell}_{[f(u)=a]}.
231		\]
232	\end{lemma}
233	\begin{proof}
234		\leanok
235		Each subtest accepts exactly when the two measurement outcomes agree. Because the relevant families are measurements, Lemma~\ref{prop:simeq-for-measurements} rewrites those acceptance probabilities as consistency bounds.
236	\end{proof}
